// Which face of `rect` the ball must exit from, given the entry: for a swept
// entry (t > 0) it is the face the segment crossed; for an overlap (t = 0) it
// is the nearest face (the ball is pushed out of the rectangle).
function exitFace(ball, rect, t, axis) {
